<title>POLAND: Kredyt says new issue oversubscribed.</title>
<headline>Kredyt says new issue oversubscribed.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish Kredyt Bank SA received subscriptions for more than 10.6 million shares in its new share offering of 10 million shares at 8.3 zlotys each, the bank said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>Kredyt Bank said the shares, eight million of which went in the large-investor tranche last week, would be allotted this Wednesday.</p>
<p>The bank is also offering the European Bank for Reconstruction and Development (EBRD) 635,000 to 847,000 new shares on May 5 and 6.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
